---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
import huss from '../assets/photos/huss-studio.jpg';
import { business } from '../data/site';
import { process } from '../data/offer';
---

<section
	id="about"
	class="border-y border-line bg-ink-2 py-24 md:py-32"
	aria-labelledby="about-heading"
>
	<div class="container-x grid items-center gap-14 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20">
		<figure class="reveal relative">
			<div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem]">
				<Picture
					src={huss}
					alt="Huss Sarwari preparing a polishing pad beside an orange supercar in the studio"
					formats={['avif']}
					fallbackFormat="webp"
					widths={[480, 720, 1080]}
					sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 560px, 100vw"
					class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover object-[42%_50%]"
				/>
			</div>
			<figcaption class="absolute -bottom-6 left-5 max-w-[17rem] rounded-2xl bg-ember p-5 text-ink shadow-2xl sm:left-auto sm:-right-6">
				<p class="font-wide text-sm leading-snug font-bold">
					“If you want it done right, you’re in the right place.”
				</p>
				<p class="mt-2 text-xs font-semibold opacity-75">{business.founder}, founder</p>
			</figcaption>
		</figure>

		<div>
			<SectionHeading eyebrow="About the studio" id="about-heading">
				Not a volume shop. <span class="serif-accent">Never will be.</span>
			</SectionHeading>
			<div class="reveal mt-8 space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-mute">
				<p>
					{business.founder} got hooked on cars the day he got his Ps, and spent years cleaning,
					refining and learning on his own car. He launched Xee Detailing professionally at 22 with
					one goal: to do things properly, not quickly.
				</p>
				<p>
					Every car that comes into the Hallam studio gets his time and attention. No rushed jobs,
					no shortcuts, and products he trusts: Huss is an authorised NXTZEN installer.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="container-x mt-28">
		<p class="reveal eyebrow">How every job runs</p>
		<ol class="mt-10 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-line bg-line md:grid-cols-4">
			{process.map((step, i) => (
				<li class="reveal bg-ink-2 p-7">
					<span class="font-wide text-4xl font-black text-ember/80">
						{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}
					</span>
					<h3 class="font-wide mt-5 text-lg font-bold">{step.title}</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-mute">{step.body}</p>
				</li>
			))}
		</ol>
	</div>
</section>
